## Status

This chart is scaffolding for the OpenVox DB implementation. It does not deploy
OpenVox DB yet. Only optional service-account creation is implemented. Workload,
networking, database connectivity, TLS, storage, and probe configuration are pending.
The image repository, image tag, and application version will be selected during implementation.

The values below include every required value from `docs/chart-standards.md`,
including workload settings and secure defaults. Only naming overrides and
service-account settings are currently wired to templates. Remaining values
will be wired during implementation.

